<%#
    "Checking your access" — the one card the theme shows while a Worker decides
    what this identity may see. Used by the encrypted-post gate, the taxonomy
    gate and the management console, so all three wait in the same way.

    Callers pass `text`; the client repaints the same markup when it re-enters
    the probing state (plugins/vault.js, plugins/blog-management.js).
%>
<div class="access-probe" role="status">
    <div class="access-probe-lock">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-lock-keyhole" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </div>
    <p class="access-probe-text"><%= text %></p>
    <div class="access-probe-bar"><span></span></div>
</div>
